(4087290, 584503, 32378, '<td valign="top">Looks like the mighty Cuyahoga.  I kinda like the red tones, gives it somewhat of an rustic industrial type feel. Although its too bad the boat wasn''t closer would be easier to tell if it was opening or closing.  I would have liked the bridge a tad sharper too.</td>', 'Looks like the mighty Cuyahoga.  I kinda like the red tones, gives it somewhat of an rustic industrial type feel. Although its too bad the boat wasn''t closer would be easier to tell if it was opening or closing.  I would have liked the bridge a tad sharper too.', '2007-09-13 12:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
