(4094748, 585781, 73747, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a fly caught in a spider web? So it does not show something closing. Cool photo, tho. The fly is a little lacking in sharpness. (5)</td>', 'This appears to be a fly caught in a spider web? So it does not show something closing. Cool photo, tho. The fly is a little lacking in sharpness. (5)', '2007-09-16 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
