(4095128, 585737, 34618, '<td valign="top">Cute. I bet this took a few takes.  Looks like you were using your "top shelf" system, too (not). The colors are compelling.</td>', 'Cute. I bet this took a few takes.  Looks like you were using your "top shelf" system, too (not). The colors are compelling.', '2007-09-17 01:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4095134, 585564, 34618, '<td valign="top">This is cute and her eyes are closed, so I guess that''s the closing?? Focus is good, your whites are blown, though. Cropping out the top of her head seems a bit painful. The backlight on her hair is really nice. I bet if you have filtered the sun (?) with a drape, the lighting would have been perfect with no blown whites and her forehead very smoothly lit.</td>', 'This is cute and her eyes are closed, so I guess that''s the closing?? Focus is good, your whites are blown, though. Cropping out the top of her head seems a bit painful. The backlight on her hair is really nice. I bet if you have filtered the sun (?) with a drape, the lighting would have been perfect with no blown whites and her forehead very smoothly lit.', '2007-09-17 01:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4095184, 585759, 34618, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. The leaf is perfect. The colors are fantastic. The ripples are mesmerizing and I hope my 10 helps you get a ribbon on this ''cuz it''s a winner.<br/>One thing... I would have spotted out the hot pixel and the sensor dust on the right and left sides of the ripple on the right toward the front. Also looks like a little sensor dust on the same ripple near the bend. If it''s not sensor dust, it sure looks enough like it that I bet you''d run the DQ gauntlet clean anyway.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. The leaf is perfect. The colors are fantastic. The ripples are mesmerizing and I hope my 10 helps you get a ribbon on this ''cuz it''s a winner.One thing... I would have spotted out the hot pixel and the sensor dust on the right and left sides of the ripple on the right toward the front. Also looks like a little sensor dust on the same ripple near the bend. If it''s not sensor dust, it sure looks enough like it that I bet you''d run the DQ gauntlet clean anyway.', '2007-09-17 01:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4095186, 585011, 34618, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. Not sure about the title, though. Definitely a strong 9.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. Not sure about the title, though. Definitely a strong 9.', '2007-09-17 01:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4095197, 585816, 34618, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Nice colors. Your lighting (sun?) appears to have been so bright you lost your shadow detail, though. Also, this looks a bit too sharpened, IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Nice colors. Your lighting (sun?) appears to have been so bright you lost your shadow detail, though. Also, this looks a bit too sharpened, IMHO.', '2007-09-17 01:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
