(4095209, 584879, 34618, '<td valign="top">Very crisp. Nice. I''m voting 10. This is a great balance of colors, especially the little spash of red on the button hole with blue jean holding it all together. Nice comp, too.</td>', 'Very crisp. Nice. I''m voting 10. This is a great balance of colors, especially the little spash of red on the button hole with blue jean holding it all together. Nice comp, too.', '2007-09-17 01:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4095231, 584392, 34618, '<td valign="top">I''m betting that you didn''t shoot this with a graduated ND filter. If so, you lost a golden opportunity to keep your foreground somewhat in tact. It''s a cool  (actually hot!) comp, but too much foreground detail seems lost that filtration would have saved. The sun is totally awesome, though. I hope you''re being careful of your eyes.</td>', 'I''m betting that you didn''t shoot this with a graduated ND filter. If so, you lost a golden opportunity to keep your foreground somewhat in tact. It''s a cool  (actually hot!) comp, but too much foreground detail seems lost that filtration would have saved. The sun is totally awesome, though. I hope you''re being careful of your eyes.', '2007-09-17 01:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
