(4097377, 585422, 54033, '<td valign="top">Are you  a Pakistani or a Hindi?</td>', 'Are you  a Pakistani or a Hindi?', '2007-09-17 20:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097524, 585196, 52169, '<td valign="top">creepy,scary and I love the bright white dress. I like it.</td>', 'creepy,scary and I love the bright white dress. I like it.', '2007-09-17 21:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097553, 585651, 41047, '<td valign="top">this has a very nice feel to it.</td>', 'this has a very nice feel to it.', '2007-09-17 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097556, 585299, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the depth of field and the warm lighting. Very good shot</td>', 'I like the composition, the depth of field and the warm lighting. Very good shot', '2007-09-17 21:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097558, 585759, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, has a very nice dreamy look.</td>', 'this is beautiful, has a very nice dreamy look.', '2007-09-17 21:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097559, 583991, 25218, '<td valign="top">Wow - very close! I like how the soft blue background complements the soft yellow tones of the fur. Cute picture!</td>', 'Wow - very close! I like how the soft blue background complements the soft yellow tones of the fur. Cute picture!', '2007-09-17 21:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097564, 585362, 25218, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was that the composition seemed a little "off" to me, but upon reflection, I think this picture is lovely just as it is.</td>', 'My first reaction was that the composition seemed a little "off" to me, but upon reflection, I think this picture is lovely just as it is.', '2007-09-17 21:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097573, 585768, 25218, '<td valign="top">Wow, you exposed this perfectly - great cloud texture in sky, and you can still see details in the reflection on the water. Excellent work.</td>', 'Wow, you exposed this perfectly - great cloud texture in sky, and you can still see details in the reflection on the water. Excellent work.', '2007-09-17 21:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097594, 585759, 25218, '<td valign="top">this is almost perfect, but the solid bands of color looks like you pushed the saturation just a little too far. 9</td>', 'this is almost perfect, but the solid bands of color looks like you pushed the saturation just a little too far. 9', '2007-09-17 21:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097601, 585033, 25218, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this - great composition and repetition, focus is spot on, and great tone throughout.</td>', 'I love everything about this - great composition and repetition, focus is spot on, and great tone throughout.', '2007-09-17 21:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097604, 583656, 25218, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the tight depth of field focused on the period. great idea, very well executed.</td>', 'I love the colors and the tight depth of field focused on the period. great idea, very well executed.', '2007-09-17 21:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097610, 585620, 25218, '<td valign="top">Wow - great lighting and perfect shot for the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'Wow - great lighting and perfect shot for the challenge. Good luck!', '2007-09-17 21:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097622, 585656, 84286, '<td valign="top">I would have looked for a page that also said THE END</td>', 'I would have looked for a page that also said THE END', '2007-09-17 21:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097684, 585816, 84286, '<td valign="top">You might try adding some motion blur so the viewer thinks the door is closing.</td>', 'You might try adding some motion blur so the viewer thinks the door is closing.', '2007-09-17 22:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097978, 585781, 84106, '<td valign="top">Rare shot.  Bit of a "stretch" for topic.</td>', 'Rare shot.  Bit of a "stretch" for topic.', '2007-09-17 23:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097995, 585422, 84106, '<td valign="top">Closing not obvious to outsider like me.  Nice colour, focus.</td>', 'Closing not obvious to outsider like me.  Nice colour, focus.', '2007-09-17 23:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098006, 585330, 84106, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Stunning!  I don''t like the black blob at lower left.  Tighter cropping at left and bottom might have made a better pic.  Otherwise, great technicals.</td>', 'Beautiful! Stunning!  I don''t like the black blob at lower left.  Tighter cropping at left and bottom might have made a better pic.  Otherwise, great technicals.', '2007-09-18 00:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098017, 585620, 84106, '<td valign="top">HURRY!  Good concept.  Great framing and focus.</td>', 'HURRY!  Good concept.  Great framing and focus.', '2007-09-18 00:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098402, 584503, 84356, '<td valign="top">beautiful colour</td>', 'beautiful colour', '2007-09-18 07:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098705, 584918, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot and as a former second row I know how much fun shutting that door can be</td>', 'Nice action shot and as a former second row I know how much fun shutting that door can be', '2007-09-18 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098708, 585735, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice example of the closing of the day, love the turquoise strip of light in the bottom left hand corner</td>', 'Very nice example of the closing of the day, love the turquoise strip of light in the bottom left hand corner', '2007-09-18 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098715, 585576, 68035, '<td valign="top">Almost too good a photo for the challenge in that excellent quality the black and white conversion does not really (to me) convey a sense of end of life/decay.  Great image though which is very attractive</td>', 'Almost too good a photo for the challenge in that excellent quality the black and white conversion does not really (to me) convey a sense of end of life/decay.  Great image though which is very attractive', '2007-09-18 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098718, 585481, 68035, '<td valign="top">A real grow on you photo, the way you have got both the flower and the bee infocus is excellent and there is a very real sense of the bee closing in on the pollen...Bumped to 7</td>', 'A real grow on you photo, the way you have got both the flower and the bee infocus is excellent and there is a very real sense of the bee closing in on the pollen...Bumped to 7', '2007-09-18 11:46:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4098721, 584622, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice close of day shot which is very good for the challenge, the framing of the sky with the trees is great</td>', 'Nice close of day shot which is very good for the challenge, the framing of the sky with the trees is great', '2007-09-18 11:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098729, 584863, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK, this may sound very pernickity on what is a good action shot, but it would have been even better if somehow you had been able to capture the scoreboard in the image to provide even more ''proof'' that it was the last shot of the game.  Real nice composition though and the lack of noise in the image is excellent</td>', 'OK, this may sound very pernickity on what is a good action shot, but it would have been even better if somehow you had been able to capture the scoreboard in the image to provide even more ''proof'' that it was the last shot of the game.  Real nice composition though and the lack of noise in the image is excellent', '2007-09-18 11:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098735, 584991, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK no doubt you will get some people saying that this is not something in the act of closing but rather something that is closed.  Hopefully people wont be too picky on this because I think it meets the challenge well and that the duotone works very well with the image adding a sense of age and decay</td>', 'OK no doubt you will get some people saying that this is not something in the act of closing but rather something that is closed.  Hopefully people wont be too picky on this because I think it meets the challenge well and that the duotone works very well with the image adding a sense of age and decay', '2007-09-18 11:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098747, 585071, 68035, '<td valign="top">I really like this concept of this shot (which I am guessing rather than being a mirror is a print that you have stuck in a frame).  Two minor points which detract a touch from it is the fact that the frame is not straight on the wall (gee I know that sounds really nitpicking but it does have a strange impact on the shot) and also that there seems to be (on my monitor) quite a bit of blow out over the top of the frame</td>', 'I really like this concept of this shot (which I am guessing rather than being a mirror is a print that you have stuck in a frame).  Two minor points which detract a touch from it is the fact that the frame is not straight on the wall (gee I know that sounds really nitpicking but it does have a strange impact on the shot) and also that there seems to be (on my monitor) quite a bit of blow out over the top of the frame', '2007-09-18 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098752, 585768, 68035, '<td valign="top">One of a number of good end of day pictures.  For me (and I appreciate this may sound a bit stupid given the topic) it is almost a little too dark and maybe it would have been better cropped slightly more from the bottom</td>', 'One of a number of good end of day pictures.  For me (and I appreciate this may sound a bit stupid given the topic) it is almost a little too dark and maybe it would have been better cropped slightly more from the bottom', '2007-09-18 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098756, 585618, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great dusk shot and the capture of the setting sun is excellent. To my taste its a good shot but somehow lacks awow factor to make it a truly great one</td>', 'Great dusk shot and the capture of the setting sun is excellent. To my taste its a good shot but somehow lacks awow factor to make it a truly great one', '2007-09-18 11:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098762, 585732, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice end of the day shot, the reflected sun really adds to this picture and the diagonal leading line of the wave is great</td>', 'Very nice end of the day shot, the reflected sun really adds to this picture and the diagonal leading line of the wave is great', '2007-09-18 11:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098766, 584998, 68035, '<td valign="top">A grower of a shot, I like the POV and the fact that you have actually got the gate latch in the act of closing.  Possibly could have done with a slighter shallower dof to make the grass behind (which is a bit drab imo) more bokeh.  The more I see this though the more I like it bump to 7</td>', 'A grower of a shot, I like the POV and the fact that you have actually got the gate latch in the act of closing.  Possibly could have done with a slighter shallower dof to make the grass behind (which is a bit drab imo) more bokeh.  The more I see this though the more I like it bump to 7', '2007-09-18 11:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098770, 585783, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice photo that makes the viewer almost wince as they look at it.  May sound odd but the mug on the top right of the frame is a little ditracting</td>', 'Nice photo that makes the viewer almost wince as they look at it.  May sound odd but the mug on the top right of the frame is a little ditracting', '2007-09-18 12:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098779, 585330, 68035, '<td valign="top">I think the first time I looked at this shot I may have been suffering from a surfeit of ''close of the day'' images in the challenge.  Revisiting it fresh I can see far more beauty in it and the cotrast between the midnight blue of the sky, the light from the setting sun and the house lights is great.  Bump to 7</td>', 'I think the first time I looked at this shot I may have been suffering from a surfeit of ''close of the day'' images in the challenge.  Revisiting it fresh I can see far more beauty in it and the cotrast between the midnight blue of the sky, the light from the setting sun and the house lights is great.  Bump to 7', '2007-09-18 12:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098787, 585468, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK on a positive note I have to say I absolutely love this picture in terms of the composition, textures and multiple leading lines.  Having said that I dont know whether it really strikes me as the closing of the day (the shadows seem both a bit too pronounced and a little short for this)<br/> <br/>A very beautiful image nonetheless</td>', 'OK on a positive note I have to say I absolutely love this picture in terms of the composition, textures and multiple leading lines.  Having said that I dont know whether it really strikes me as the closing of the day (the shadows seem both a bit too pronounced and a little short for this) A very beautiful image nonetheless', '2007-09-18 12:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098795, 584462, 68035, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of pictures of signs.  It meets the challenge well in a very different way to most entries and the colour contrasts between the sign and the sky are great.  Somehow it seems a little off in terms of composition (if you look at the sky on the lower right of the sign and that on the lower left you can see they are quite different and (to my tastes) this would have worked even better if it had been perfectly centred<br/> <br/>Still a good job though</td>', 'I am a big fan of pictures of signs.  It meets the challenge well in a very different way to most entries and the colour contrasts between the sign and the sky are great.  Somehow it seems a little off in terms of composition (if you look at the sky on the lower right of the sign and that on the lower left you can see they are quite different and (to my tastes) this would have worked even better if it had been perfectly centred Still a good job though', '2007-09-18 12:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098800, 585651, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice image that uses shadows well to convey the end of the day.  It feels like it wants to be a great picture (possibly a ribbon winner) but that somehow something doesnt quite work.  Having thought about this I just wonder whether the chair makes the frame slightly cluttered and whether it would have been better without it.<br/> <br/>Still a great shot</td>', 'Very nice image that uses shadows well to convey the end of the day.  It feels like it wants to be a great picture (possibly a ribbon winner) but that somehow something doesnt quite work.  Having thought about this I just wonder whether the chair makes the frame slightly cluttered and whether it would have been better without it. Still a great shot', '2007-09-18 12:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098809, 585708, 68035, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhh I can see this having its fair share of admirers and haters in voting<br/> <br/>Very original.  Find it simulatenously amusing and disturbing I have to say the hole in the sock is quite distracting in terms of getting the ''story'' of the shot across</td>', 'Ohhhhh I can see this having its fair share of admirers and haters in voting Very original.  Find it simulatenously amusing and disturbing I have to say the hole in the sock is quite distracting in terms of getting the ''story'' of the shot across', '2007-09-18 12:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098810, 584988, 68035, '<td valign="top">Excellent faceless portrait, and I love the conversion which adds a level of distance between the viewer and the subject that compliments the shot well</td>', 'Excellent faceless portrait, and I love the conversion which adds a level of distance between the viewer and the subject that compliments the shot well', '2007-09-18 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098816, 583958, 68035, '<td valign="top">Bit of a quandry here, I love the photo which is very simple and effective (great Bokeh by the way) but - even given the title - I am not quite sure that it fills the criteria of showing something in the act of closing</td>', 'Bit of a quandry here, I love the photo which is very simple and effective (great Bokeh by the way) but - even given the title - I am not quite sure that it fills the criteria of showing something in the act of closing', '2007-09-18 12:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098821, 585690, 68035, '<td valign="top">Undeniably a brilliant macro although having looked and looked I cant quite get it in terms of showing something in the act of closing (is it the spiders mouth or feelers)</td>', 'Undeniably a brilliant macro although having looked and looked I cant quite get it in terms of showing something in the act of closing (is it the spiders mouth or feelers)', '2007-09-18 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098823, 585816, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very simple and minimalistic and even though you cant see motion blur you do get the idea of something closing.  The shadow of the handle adds a nice element to the composition</td>', 'Very simple and minimalistic and even though you cant see motion blur you do get the idea of something closing.  The shadow of the handle adds a nice element to the composition', '2007-09-18 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098824, 585466, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well congrats from me for showing a close of day image without feeling the need to hammer it home in the title.  Beautiful sky colouring which goes very well with the trees and the myriad of red flowers on the ground.  Bump to 7</td>', 'Well congrats from me for showing a close of day image without feeling the need to hammer it home in the title.  Beautiful sky colouring which goes very well with the trees and the myriad of red flowers on the ground.  Bump to 7', '2007-09-18 12:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098825, 585759, 68035, '<td valign="top">This is such a subtle photo.  I really like it and hope it does well for you (although given that the first time I looked at it it didnt immediately slap me round the face I wonder how it will do with speed votes).  Outsanding focus dof and colouring.  The boarder also works very well.  Bump to 8</td>', 'This is such a subtle photo.  I really like it and hope it does well for you (although given that the first time I looked at it it didnt immediately slap me round the face I wonder how it will do with speed votes).  Outsanding focus dof and colouring.  The boarder also works very well.  Bump to 8', '2007-09-18 12:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098830, 585563, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very clever shot, in some ways it may be a little too clever as the first time I saw it I just thought it was a person in a glass fronted elevator.  Obviously on revisiting it I can see that the elevator door is solid and you have done a great motion blur job.  Perhpas lacks a real ''zing'' to it that would see it win a ribbon, but a great entry in the challenge nonetheless</td>', 'Very clever shot, in some ways it may be a little too clever as the first time I saw it I just thought it was a person in a glass fronted elevator.  Obviously on revisiting it I can see that the elevator door is solid and you have done a great motion blur job.  Perhpas lacks a real ''zing'' to it that would see it win a ribbon, but a great entry in the challenge nonetheless', '2007-09-18 12:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098833, 585717, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely colourful capture of what almost looks like it could be a sulky slam the door moments</td>', 'Lovely colourful capture of what almost looks like it could be a sulky slam the door moments', '2007-09-18 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098835, 585584, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very very nice fish eye and the cyclist does add to the image.</td>', 'Very very nice fish eye and the cyclist does add to the image.', '2007-09-18 12:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098836, 583540, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice close of day shot although a little small</td>', 'Nice close of day shot although a little small', '2007-09-18 12:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098838, 585796, 68035, '<td valign="top">A very clever and subtle take on the challenge which is matched by the photo itself.  May not be to everyone''s liking but I have to say I think its cool</td>', 'A very clever and subtle take on the challenge which is matched by the photo itself.  May not be to everyone''s liking but I have to say I think its cool', '2007-09-18 12:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098841, 585145, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, which provides quite a difference tale on the challenge.  You can almost feel the trouble in the air</td>', 'Interesting shot, which provides quite a difference tale on the challenge.  You can almost feel the trouble in the air', '2007-09-18 12:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098843, 585793, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea although unfortunately for me it lacks a little bit of context</td>', 'Interesting idea although unfortunately for me it lacks a little bit of context', '2007-09-18 12:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098845, 585503, 68035, '<td valign="top">good close (or should that be opening) of the day shot, beautiful sky colouring</td>', 'good close (or should that be opening) of the day shot, beautiful sky colouring', '2007-09-18 12:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098849, 585729, 68035, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot although for me it doesnt really shout closing at me love the softness of the baby''s skin</td>', 'Interesting shot although for me it doesnt really shout closing at me love the softness of the baby''s skin', '2007-09-18 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098896, 585228, 68035, '<td valign="top">Good idea but on my monitor the last rays of sunshine coming through the clouds have a very strange blown out effect</td>', 'Good idea but on my monitor the last rays of sunshine coming through the clouds have a very strange blown out effect', '2007-09-18 12:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098900, 584615, 68035, '<td valign="top">Guessing this is a spider either closing a strand of a web or closing in on a victim trapped in it.  Unfortunately the focus is slightly out on this which is a shame as it looked like it could have been a great image</td>', 'Guessing this is a spider either closing a strand of a web or closing in on a victim trapped in it.  Unfortunately the focus is slightly out on this which is a shame as it looked like it could have been a great image', '2007-09-18 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098901, 585628, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK, it could be me just being stupid but I doont get this at all - sorry</td>', 'OK, it could be me just being stupid but I doont get this at all - sorry', '2007-09-18 12:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098909, 585564, 68035, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this shot doesnt really work for me (the expression makes me giggle though because all I can think of is contipation).  Think this was a really good idea but perhaps the context of the shot could have been better (perhaps in a bedroom rather than outside by a wall)</td>', 'Sorry but this shot doesnt really work for me (the expression makes me giggle though because all I can think of is contipation).  Think this was a really good idea but perhaps the context of the shot could have been better (perhaps in a bedroom rather than outside by a wall)', '2007-09-18 12:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098910, 585480, 84209, '<td valign="top">very nice. it''s hard to maintain good focus in a shot like this.</td>', 'very nice. it''s hard to maintain good focus in a shot like this.', '2007-09-18 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098911, 585440, 68035, '<td valign="top">cute picture, like the reflection and definitely meets the idea of the challenge</td>', 'cute picture, like the reflection and definitely meets the idea of the challenge', '2007-09-18 12:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098913, 584069, 68035, '<td valign="top">I do like this as a portrait (although possibly the focus could have been a little tighter).  Lovely smile on the face of the girl.  To be honest it feels a little bit shoehorned (pardon the pun) into the challenge, but a good shot nonetheless</td>', 'I do like this as a portrait (although possibly the focus could have been a little tighter).  Lovely smile on the face of the girl.  To be honest it feels a little bit shoehorned (pardon the pun) into the challenge, but a good shot nonetheless', '2007-09-18 13:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098914, 583974, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, if you drink this much brandy at closing time, I hope you dont have to drive home!!!!</td>', 'Wow, if you drink this much brandy at closing time, I hope you dont have to drive home!!!!', '2007-09-18 13:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098915, 585362, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not an expression that I am familiar with, very nicely composed although the two weeds in the forground are a little distracting</td>', 'Not an expression that I am familiar with, very nicely composed although the two weeds in the forground are a little distracting', '2007-09-18 13:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098916, 583891, 37653, '<td valign="top">Very Very Very Clever, I will be amazed if this does not win</td>', 'Very Very Very Clever, I will be amazed if this does not win', '2007-09-18 13:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098919, 584138, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely close of day shot the sun reflection which falls over the rock is a very nice touch 6</td>', 'Lovely close of day shot the sun reflection which falls over the rock is a very nice touch 6', '2007-09-18 13:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098920, 585426, 68035, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the sun going down over the horizon.  It looks like the full stop (or period) at the end of a great day out at the beach</td>', 'Good capture of the sun going down over the horizon.  It looks like the full stop (or period) at the end of a great day out at the beach', '2007-09-18 13:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098921, 584001, 68035, '<td valign="top">Good shot that definitely meets the challenge, perhaps lacks a little pop, but a nice slice of life</td>', 'Good shot that definitely meets the challenge, perhaps lacks a little pop, but a nice slice of life', '2007-09-18 13:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4098927, 585422, 68035, '<td valign="top">And age shall not dim their memories.  Nice emotive shot shame that the soldier on the right had a sheaf of papers (though I appreciate that there is little you can do about that) and there seems to be a little bit of blow out on the same soldiers forearm.  A shot that makes me want to know more about what was happening</td>', 'And age shall not dim their memories.  Nice emotive shot shame that the soldier on the right had a sheaf of papers (though I appreciate that there is little you can do about that) and there seems to be a little bit of blow out on the same soldiers forearm.  A shot that makes me want to know more about what was happening', '2007-09-18 13:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4099128, 585628, 63920, '<td valign="top">I really don''t understand this</td>', 'I really don''t understand this', '2007-09-18 15:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4099159, 585468, 23921, '<td valign="top">beautiful and artistic</td>', 'beautiful and artistic', '2007-09-18 15:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
