(4100451, 585759, 73250, '<td valign="top">Oh my Jason...another ribbon!! Congrats, well deserved teammate...can you save some of this for league??? T.</td>', 'Oh my Jason...another ribbon!! Congrats, well deserved teammate...can you save some of this for league??? T.', '2007-09-19 01:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100453, 585732, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice finish Shez</td>', 'Nice finish Shez', '2007-09-19 01:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100455, 584918, 10047, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jonfrommk:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice action shot and as a former second row I know how much fun shutting that door can be </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m a former 2nd row also, but not former enough. I played in an Old Boys match this May and I''m still on the mend. Made it through all 80 minutes, but the Outside Center kept missing his tackles, and I kept picking them up. I went 5 for 7 on high speed open field tackles, and my right shoulder won''t let me forget it. Pretty sad rugby when a 50 year old can bust out of a scrum and make midfield tackles. LOL.</td>', 'Originally posted by jonfrommk: Nice action shot and as a former second row I know how much fun shutting that door can be   I''m a former 2nd row also, but not former enough. I played in an Old Boys match this May and I''m still on the mend. Made it through all 80 minutes, but the Outside Center kept missing his tackles, and I kept picking them up. I went 5 for 7 on high speed open field tackles, and my right shoulder won''t let me forget it. Pretty sad rugby when a 50 year old can bust out of a scrum and make midfield tackles. LOL.', '2007-09-19 01:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100485, 585330, 80511, '<td valign="top">Wow, my first ribbon. Many thanks to everyone:-)<br/> <br/>This was a bit of a lucky shot. My wife was going to the dentist one evening, so I decided to take the camera and get a few shots while waiting. I was fortunate that it was such a beautiful evening and happened to be in the right location at the right time, and most importantly - with a camera.<br/> <br/>The only editing was a crop and sharpening. I tried tinkering a little but it didn''t add anything to the photo, so I decided to go with the original (luckily). <br/> <br/>Once again, wow, many thanks.</td>', 'Wow, my first ribbon. Many thanks to everyone:-) This was a bit of a lucky shot. My wife was going to the dentist one evening, so I decided to take the camera and get a few shots while waiting. I was fortunate that it was such a beautiful evening and happened to be in the right location at the right time, and most importantly - with a camera. The only editing was a crop and sharpening. I tried tinkering a little but it didn''t add anything to the photo, so I decided to go with the original (luckily).  Once again, wow, many thanks.', '2007-09-19 01:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100500, 585781, 70661, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture! I like!</td>', 'Very cool capture! I like!', '2007-09-19 01:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100527, 585768, 66384, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmm, my kind of sky. I love the clouds. Too bad they don''t reflect brighter in the lake. I guess that could be fixed with advanced editing. I''d like to see just a bit more light on the shoreline too, because I am being lead to a point in the center of the shore, and then I can''t see it when I get there.</td>', 'Mmmmmm, my kind of sky. I love the clouds. Too bad they don''t reflect brighter in the lake. I guess that could be fixed with advanced editing. I''d like to see just a bit more light on the shoreline too, because I am being lead to a point in the center of the shore, and then I can''t see it when I get there.', '2007-09-19 01:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100532, 585781, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, so delicate.  Love the colors in the background, too.  Congrats!</td>', 'Oh, so delicate.  Love the colors in the background, too.  Congrats!', '2007-09-19 01:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
