(4100563, 585330, 68504, '<td valign="top">Gave you a 9, and started a comment but never finished it. First, congrats on a worthy ribbon; second, I wanted to say how the blur on the water indicated the motion of time/day closing; third, this looks even better now I notice your excellent vanishing point.</td>', 'Gave you a 9, and started a comment but never finished it. First, congrats on a worthy ribbon; second, I wanted to say how the blur on the water indicated the motion of time/day closing; third, this looks even better now I notice your excellent vanishing point.', '2007-09-19 01:47:03.000000', NULL, 0),
