(4100588, 583991, 67145, '<td valign="top">excellent photograph .. that mouth, its shape, the whiskers, the way its lined up on the page .. BRILLIANT .. congrats on your 17th place .. :)</td>', 'excellent photograph .. that mouth, its shape, the whiskers, the way its lined up on the page .. BRILLIANT .. congrats on your 17th place .. :)', '2007-09-19 01:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
