(4100938, 583668, 60981, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by maymay:</b></div><hr/><i> if your hand was not there if bee better </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Can''t remove hand sadly without cutting out the various parts of the trap.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jlscott3:</b></div><hr/><i> Pretty good...getting the whole trap in sharp focus would make this a more interesting picture, I think </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Taken at 1/6400 of a second. Not sure if I could get it in focus even at 1/8000 in full sunlight due to how fast the jaw moves (definitely a future experiment though). Not even sure if 1/8000th of a second is fast enough to capture the jaw closing period heh. If only there was a camera with a faster shutter speed lol.<br/> <br/>Thanks for those of you who realized how hard this shot was, technically-speaking. Sadly, it still came out crappy looking, so the score is reasonable considering.<br/> <br/>Still learning and there''s always the next challenge though ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by maymay: if your hand was not there if bee better  Can''t remove hand sadly without cutting out the various parts of the trap. Originally posted by jlscott3: Pretty good...getting the whole trap in sharp focus would make this a more interesting picture, I think   Taken at 1/6400 of a second. Not sure if I could get it in focus even at 1/8000 in full sunlight due to how fast the jaw moves (definitely a future experiment though). Not even sure if 1/8000th of a second is fast enough to capture the jaw closing period heh. If only there was a camera with a faster shutter speed lol. Thanks for those of you who realized how hard this shot was, technically-speaking. Sadly, it still came out crappy looking, so the score is reasonable considering. Still learning and there''s always the next challenge though ;)', '2007-09-19 05:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100943, 583891, 33535, '<td valign="top">haha, congrats on the blue, this is such a fun pic!</td>', 'haha, congrats on the blue, this is such a fun pic!', '2007-09-19 05:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100945, 585759, 69368, '<td valign="top">Jason! Another ribbon! You are the ribbon-winner of the year 2007, IMO!<br/>Big Congrats on the red!<br/> <br/>BTW: it''s a great shot!<br/></td>', 'Jason! Another ribbon! You are the ribbon-winner of the year 2007, IMO!Big Congrats on the red! BTW: it''s a great shot!', '2007-09-19 05:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
