(4101151, 585759, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon, I really like the minimalistic and simple composition and clean look to it.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon, I really like the minimalistic and simple composition and clean look to it.', '2007-09-19 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 0),
