(4113316, 585768, 61651, '<td valign="top">It''s a tad underexposed, in the sense that if you wanted to get a bit more detail in the water you could have slowed the shutter speed just enough to do that without seriously compromising that fantastic sky, but even so you''ve got good drama here with these shadows and shadows of shadows.  Looks like the clouds are settling in for a long nap.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-24 21:08:39.</i></td>', 'It''s a tad underexposed, in the sense that if you wanted to get a bit more detail in the water you could have slowed the shutter speed just enough to do that without seriously compromising that fantastic sky, but even so you''ve got good drama here with these shadows and shadows of shadows.  Looks like the clouds are settling in for a long nap.', '2007-09-24 21:51:15.000000', '2007-09-24 22:08:39.000000', 0),
(4113322, 585696, 61651, '<td valign="top">Achingly intimate shot.  His expression could be read any number of ways - at the moment I see him as protesting going to bed, as all the while his eyelids are getting more and more heavy.</td>', 'Achingly intimate shot.  His expression could be read any number of ways - at the moment I see him as protesting going to bed, as all the while his eyelids are getting more and more heavy.', '2007-09-24 21:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
