(4113767, 585196, 61818, '<td valign="top">Critique Club feedback - <br/> <br/>Wow, great lighting here.  You really nailed the ghost effect.  <br/> <br/>This scored pretty well in a challenge that seemed to be looking for specific actions (closing), and that''s due to the great technicals I''m sure.<br/> <br/>Only suggestions would be to completely lift the blinds.  The thin vertical lines don''t help the image.  Also a slightly tighter crop to get rid of the off kilter edges of the wall around the window frame.<br/> <br/>Good stuff, I like this shot.</td>', 'Critique Club feedback -  Wow, great lighting here.  You really nailed the ghost effect.   This scored pretty well in a challenge that seemed to be looking for specific actions (closing), and that''s due to the great technicals I''m sure. Only suggestions would be to completely lift the blinds.  The thin vertical lines don''t help the image.  Also a slightly tighter crop to get rid of the off kilter edges of the wall around the window frame. Good stuff, I like this shot.', '2007-09-25 00:49:06.000000', NULL, 0),
